        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This deliberately long paragraph exercises real justification across several lines. The spaces between words should expand so that each complete line reaches both margins, while the final line remains natural. It also creates enough prose to expose wrapping and page-boundary defects without depending on a particular project. Repeated evidence makes the result easy to inspect: alpha beta gamma delta epsilon zeta eta theta iota kappa lambda mu, then alpha beta gamma delta epsilon zeta eta theta iota kappa lambda mu, and once more alpha beta gamma delta epsilon zeta eta theta iota kappa lambda mu.",
